  m_text: 'Hello! This level editor is still in development, so any bugs found with
    the editor

    should be reported in the comment section of itch.io.


    Q
    - Rotate 45 degrees anticlockwise

    E - Rotate 45 degrees clockwise

    I
    - Move block 1 unit up

    J - Move block 1 unit to the left

    K - Move block
    1 unit up

    L - Move block 1 unit to the right

    Y - save level

    Tab
    - Get metadata of level

    F2 - Load level'
